WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.085
Learn to recall multiplication facts through the tables up to 11 times 11

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.878
Calculate 4 times 10. The answer is 40. 4 groups of 10 give 40.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.444
There are 4 trays with 4 oranges in each. How many oranges are there altogether?

00:00:16.444 --> 00:00:18.975
Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:23.282
The answer is 16. 4 times 4 equals 16.
